  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 14 actions (actions.js setupActions) and 4 feedbacks (feedbacks.js setupFeedbacks, 2 boolean and 2 advanced). Variables (variables.js) are not catalogued; the module has no presets file.",
    "Protocol: WebSocket client to ws://<targetIp>:<targetPort>/ws (index.js, initWebSocket), with ping/pong every 3 s and optional reconnect after 5 s (config field reconnect). It needs the matching Office add-in running inside PowerPoint (config.js info text). Actions send JSON such as { action: \"next\" }, { slideShowActive: true }, { currentSlide: <n> } (actions.js). The add-in was not inspected.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.10.0: options do not support expressions. No option sets useVariables.",
    "Source oddities kept as written: the config field targetPort is type number with the string default \"80\" and regex Regex.PORT (config.js); slideReached compares with loose equality (feedbacks.js:28) and currentSlidePosition has numeric choice ids 0 to 4 with numeric default 0, and returns nothing for other values (feedbacks.js:31-63). The blackout, hideUnhideSlide and toggleLaserPointer dropdowns send the chosen id as the \"action\" value to the add-in; the Hide/Unhide action option \"slideId\" is sent as slideId.",
    "openPresentation sends a file path as typed to the add-in (path on the machine running PowerPoint) and closeOthers; both options are marked required, and closeOthers is a checkbox that defaults to true."
  ]
